      </td></tr></table><table><col class="asyn-l"></col><col class="asyn-r"></col><tr><td>&lt;imm6&gt;</td><td><a id="RtSoption_imm6"></a>
        
          <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">Is the range prefetch operation encoding as an immediate, in the range 0 to 63, encoded in "option&lt;2&gt;:option&lt;0&gt;:S:Rt&lt;2:0&gt;". This syntax is only for encodings that are not representable using &lt;rprfop&gt;.</p>
        
